<title>THAILAND: Singer (Thailand) Q3 net profit down.</title>
<headline>Singer (Thailand) Q3 net profit down.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>					  Third quarter</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		5.70	vs		6.25</p>
<p>    Net		     153.78	vs	    168.82</p>
<p>					  Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)	     14.92	vs	     16.80</p>
<p>    Net		     402.95	vs	    453.65</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited. Singer (Thailand) Plc is a distributor of durable goods.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
